      "statement": "PTT's system ownership register assigns each payments system a technical owner, business owner and support tier (T1 24x7 critical, T2 business hours + on-call, T3 business hours); SYS-CBO, SYS-CES, SYS-PPH, SYS-PNG-FFC, SYS-PNG-GPI, and the three PRSP systems are all T1, while SYS-CBO-SPS, SYS-ENS and SYS-TDIP are T2, and SYS-CDP (Deposits Technology) and SYS-IWB (Payment Operations Technology) are owned outside PTT but included because Payments Hub Engineering depends on them.",
