      "id": "claim_4fe55a0f2cc74eebad94db6904bc5ff4",
      "statement": "PTT change governance runs through distinct forums with fixed cadences and lead times: the monthly Payments Architecture Review Board (required for new client-facing payment integrations, 10 business days submission lead), the Payments Platform Demand Board (monthly, prioritizes the PPH roadmap), FCT Change Advisory (bi-weekly, FCC sign-off required for hold/screening changes, year-end freeze Dec-15 to Jan-05), the Disclosure Review Committee (bi-weekly, approves client-facing copy), continuous MRM Model Inventory & Validation registration before development, and Privacy Impact Assessment review (~4 weeks) for new client-data uses.",
